---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Join the CNA
metaDescription: A practical guide from WPCNA's workshop materials for residents starting, reviving, or strengthening a neighborhood association.
---
<section class="image-hero image-hero-handbook">
  <img src="{{ site.handbookHeroImage | withPrefix }}" alt="{{ site.handbookHeroImageAlt }}" loading="eager">
  <h1 class="image-hero-label"><span>Join the CNA</span></h1>
</section>

<section class="section section-join-how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="join-how">
      <p class="eyebrow">Membership</p>
      <h2>How to join the CNA</h2>
      <p class="join-how-lead">The CNA is a council of White Plains&rsquo; neighborhood associations &mdash; a forum where organized neighborhoods share ideas, work with the City, and speak with one voice. You take part <strong>through your neighborhood association</strong>, which becomes a dues-paying member of the council. Here is how it works.</p>

      <ol class="join-steps">
        <li class="join-step">
          <span class="join-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
          <div class="join-step-body">
            <h3>Find your neighborhood association</h3>
            <p>These are the member organizations of the CNA. Check whether your neighborhood already has one on our <a href="{{ '/neighborhoods/' | withPrefix }}">Neighborhoods</a> page.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="join-step">
          <span class="join-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
          <div class="join-step-body">
            <h3>Become a member of it</h3>
            <p>Join your local association and pay its dues. That is how residents take part &mdash; there is no separate individual CNA membership for the general public.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="join-step">
          <span class="join-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
          <div class="join-step-body">
            <h3>No association yet? Start one</h3>
            <p>Use the workshop guide below to adopt bylaws, elect officers, and hold a first meeting. WPCNA will help you get going.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="join-step">
          <span class="join-step-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
          <div class="join-step-body">
            <h3>Your association joins the council</h3>
            <p>Once organized, your association pays its CNA dues and sends representatives to the council&rsquo;s monthly meetings &mdash; the second Tuesday of the month at 7:00 pm, in person or on Zoom.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="join-step">
          <span class="join-step-num" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
          <div class="join-step-body">
            <h3>Add your voice</h3>
            <p>Attend meetings, share ideas, and connect with City officials and other neighborhoods across White Plains.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <aside class="join-note">
        <p><strong>Membership is for neighborhood associations and their members &mdash; not individual sign-ups from the general public.</strong> If your neighborhood is not organized yet, the guide below shows you how to change that.</p>
      </aside>

      <p class="join-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/contact/' | withPrefix }}">Questions about joining or dues? Contact the CNA</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="handbook-content">
      <article class="about-copy">
        <h2>{{ site.handbookIntroHeading }}</h2>
        {{ site.handbookIntroBody | paragraphs | safe }}

        {% for resource in site.handbookResources %}
        <h3>{{ resource.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ resource.description }}</p>
        <p class="resource-action-stack">
          <a class="btn btn-{{ resource.style }}" href="{{ resource.pdfUrl | withPrefix }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ resource.pdfLabel }}</a>
        </p>
        {% endfor %}

        <h2>{{ site.handbookUseHeading }}</h2>
        <p>{{ site.handbookUseBody }}</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
